            "review_title": "Review at It's BBQ",
            "review_text": "Rahul K\nJersey, United Kingdom20 contributions\n1\nWHY DOES THIS PLACE HAVE NO REVIEWS?! It's beautiful!\nDec 2016 • Friends\nWe stumbled upon this restaurant on TripAdvisor at about 10pm and gave them a ring. The polite staff told us that they would be open till around 1am.\n\nWe were famished, and decided to try out the barbecue this place had (quite blatantly) to offer. When we entered the place, we saw that only six tables were filled, on a Saturday night. Nevertheless, the staff were incredibly nice and were eager to translate some of the dishes for us.\n\nAn hour later, we were being served a free boiler-maker as a welcome drink. We were told that this was customary for all newcomers to the place. Moreover, all the BBQ that we ordered was fantastic. Even the draught beer was chilled and tasty!\n\nAt around 12am, we were approached by a man who offered us some Chinese rice wine. We reluctantly had it, but then realized that this man was the owner of the joint. We then chatted with him and his staff, led by the manager Nguyên. \n\nThe initial bill came up to nearly 1,400,000 VND, and we were astonished at how inexpensive the place was. As it was our last night in Vietnam, we decided to stay and order a few more drinks. We even played some darts on an electronic machine that the joint has.\n\nAll in all, we ended up staying there till 3am, with Nguyên staying up with us and even helping us catch a cab back to our hotel. This night was easily the best way to cap off an amazing vacation!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 18, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
