            "review_text": "Paul R\n1 contribution\n1\nThis is now my new favorite restaurant!\nAug 2016 • Solo\nI was a little worried that I was the only customer going in, but I was in for some very good surprises. The place is new so everything is clean and updated with a very cool international theme. Very good atmosphere even if you just go for a drink. As for drinks - they have a FULL bar and a very good selection of beers. The owner and staff are very nice, friendly and engaging. But the food - oh my - the food was outstanding. I only had a few items from their BBQ selections and I was very impressed and very much enjoyed the food. I can't wait to go back - again and again.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 24, 2016",
